ink":0,"partial":0,"fast4":0,"badChars":0},"unknown":"","meaning":{"source":{"name":"Geetham notes","author":"Gurukulam & SF","url":"","pages":[69]},"parts":[{"text":["O Goddess! Daughter of himachala, you are good fortune for the devotees. You are kind to the people in all the lokas. You are a well-wisher of Lord Shiva, you shower happiness and knowledge, and we bow to you and praise you. You have beautiful eyebrows; you are an ocean of knowledge to the world. This geetam is in nata raga, which is a parent raga. This raga has sudda 'sa', shadsruti 'ri' (level 3), antara 'ga', sudda 'ma', sudda 'pa', shadsruti 'da' (level 3) and chatushadja 'ni'. Sri Gopalaraya of the kandregula dynasty praises the Goddess with this geetam."]}],"words":[{"lyric":["SrI himAchalasutE hRta sajjanArthitate sannutahitE","lOkavitate Siva abhimatEpa sukavinatE sukavinatE","kavinatE vinatE natetE padE namAmi","subhrullatE bhaviSRtE SubhasaMgatE","kAnDrEgula vaMSa tilaka gOpala rAya vinutE","sapta svara yutA rOhana gadhArahita","avarOha yuta saMpUrNauDava Suddha shaDjashaDsRti","rishabhachyuta madhyamagAndhAra","Suddha madhyama Suddha panchama shaDsRti daivatayuta","chatushaDja nishAda samyuta mElajanya rAgagEya","Suddha nATa rAga gAnaratE","kAnDrEgula vaMSa tilaka gOpala rAya vinutE"],"text":["O Goddess! Daughter of himachala, you are good fortune for the devotees. You are kind to the people in all the lokas. You are a well-wisher of Lord Shiva, you shower happiness and knowledge, and we bow to you and praise you. You have beautiful eyebrows; you are an ocean of knowledge to the world. This geetam is in nata raga, which is a parent raga. This raga has sudda 'sa', shadsruti 'ri' (level 3), antara 'ga', sudda 'ma', sudda 'pa', shadsruti 'da' (level 3) and chatushadja 'ni'. Sri Gopalaraya of the kandregula dynasty praises the Goddess with this geetam."]}]}}
